Error [jet.BindingTypeMismatch]: `HookDecision.Fail` needs String (text), not Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/decision_hook_wrong_handler.jet:6:55
    |
  6 |     hook.on(scope, fn(value: Int) { HookDecision.Fail(value) })
    |                                                       ^^^^^
 Why: The decision payload must match the hook's declared payload or error type
 Fix: Put the value in text with interpolation: "{x}"
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108
